[{"id":3532447659,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc7SjN-r","state":"COMMENTED","user":{"site_admin":false,"suspended":false,"updated_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/180032?u=68d23e7ee9cdf810da125e8510b72f845b9dccc8&v=4","created_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","followers":0,"following":0,"html_url":"https://github.com/Calinou","id":180032,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MDAzMg==","login":"Calinou","type":"User","owned_private_repos":0,"public_gists":0,"public_repos":0,"total_private_repos":0,"url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou"},"body":"Tested locally, it works as expected. Code looks good to me.\r\n\r\n### GridMap\r\n\r\n<img width=\"2365\" height=\"897\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/1195fe14-178d-4bb3-b2f5-6e3ccb5b5aad\" />\r\n\r\n### MultiplayerSynchronizer\r\n\r\n<img width=\"2065\" height=\"894\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/a9743a0a-10f9-402d-b22c-aaa6a491a031\" />\r\n\r\nSome feedback:\r\n\r\n- If you resize the floating dock to the minimum width, elements at the top get cut off:\r\n\r\n<img width=\"573\" height=\"395\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/a3705b62-00e1-4643-85b0-c9d50573a339\" />\r\n\r\nThe minimum width without elements getting cut off appears to be around 870 pixels:\r\n\r\n<img width=\"873\" height=\"395\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/1b159a7f-dd9d-41c8-a3db-1879793c7307\" />\r\n\r\n- Selecting a node other than a GridMap will close the floating window, and selecting a GridMap node again won't make the dock floating and bring it back to its previous position/size automatically. This should be addressed in a future PR, as this also affects other closable docks. (I've only noticed it now, as working with GridMaps tends to require switching around the selected node a fair bit.)","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/113396#pullrequestreview-3532447659","pull_request